      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unaccounted: A single girl shared her sketch across the consortium&apos;s social media, while another girl narrated her story in a video, which was subsequently published on Plan International&apos;s global platforms. Furthermore, two focus group discussions (FGDs) were carried out at the regional level to integrate ideas from girls and young women into the advocacy manual and regional research. Additionally, one girl co-facilitated the regional human rights training.

